### Disaster DSS API Tests
### Requires: REST Client extension in VS Code
### Backend must be running: Task 7 "Start FastAPI Backend"

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminKey = disaster-dss-dev-key-change-in-prod

# ── Health Check ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

# ── Alerts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### List all alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts

###

### List Chitral alerts only
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?district=Chitral&active_only=true

###

### Create new alert (admin required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Flood Alert – Chitral River",
  "body": "NDMA warns of rising Chitral River levels. Communities near the river should move to higher ground immediately.",
  "hazard_type": "flood",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "issued_at": "2024-08-10T06:00:00",
  "source_org": "NDMA",
  "district": "Chitral",
  "language": "en"
}

###

# ── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tooba Iqbal",
  "email": "tooba@example.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "district": "Chitral",
  "language": "en"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tooba@example.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

###

# ── Knowledge Search ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### English search
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search?q=flood+evacuation&language=en&limit=5

###

### Urdu search
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search?q=سیلاب&language=ur&limit=5

###

### Roman Urdu search
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/search?q=selab+bachao&language=ru&limit=5

###

### Package metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/meta

###

# ── Sync ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Package sync status
GET {{baseUrl}}/sync/status

###
